=200&h=200&s=c2a772c13a048a939231866b3e981bb6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bbda2298/uploads/origins/02050ee1-c651-420f-9eaa-5fbd39f4e3d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2a772c13a048a939231866b3e981bb6, https://si.imgix.net/bbda2298/uploads/origins/02050ee1-c651-420f-9eaa-5fbd39f4e3d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8268895a95848baa73b040e9dbad017c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bbda2298/uploads/origins/02050ee1-c651-420f-9eaa-5fbd39f4e3d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d570f35de705ad939597dd4760a4212c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I loved the art that you drew for me, please draw 1 full body SD and 3 bust up SD of my vtuber!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/24pm78ammbk\n\nPlease draw the fullbody as you like!\nFor the bust up, may I request these 3 poses:\n1. with her 4 cats (https://sta.sh/21fimdu6svaq)\n2. drinking boba \n3. reading/holding her book (https://sta.sh/0xbmdxwh7u5)\n\nMay be used on YT/Twitch so please include separate layers.\nThank you very much for your consideration, I look forward to working with you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mituse_/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/92a9093b/uploads/origins/e3deb1fe-95ee-47aa-a9b2-803d2b4e1f84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f205ab00b43647498dd443381943127a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/92a9093b/uploads/origins/e3deb1fe-95ee-47aa-a9b2-803d2b4e1f84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f205ab00b43647498dd443381943127a, https://si.imgix.net/92a9093b/uploads/origins/e3deb1fe-95ee-47aa-a9b2-803d2b4e1f84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fe0f4d2b788709916d9031068557be8b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/92a9093b/uploads/origins/e3deb1fe-95ee-47aa-a9b2-803d2b4e1f84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=