tuse_/works/2\n\nレイヤーを分けて、psdファイルを送ってください\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-IqeB19QelnjVe8AKqaZUOf9SchYyfMp", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mituse_/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3991d75e/uploads/origins/9ed7bfc6-604d-42dd-b967-9e7f99d8f8b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a77bdf470c40d702bdb2f721ff3046a8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3991d75e/uploads/origins/9ed7bfc6-604d-42dd-b967-9e7f99d8f8b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a77bdf470c40d702bdb2f721ff3046a8, https://si.imgix.net/3991d75e/uploads/origins/9ed7bfc6-604d-42dd-b967-9e7f99d8f8b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=837817d9b0ea5f5d8b7c6924136e6668 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3991d75e/uploads/origins/9ed7bfc6-604d-42dd-b967-9e7f99d8f8b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=abc551c465bd3117c4b439d1f9f276e1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, your art is very pretty, I especially like this photo (https://skeb.jp/@mituse_/works/5)! Please draw 3 bustups of my new vtuber design however you like! I apologize for the sketchy design.\n\nKatrina \nhttps://sta.sh/224bonefnina\nYou may draw any version from here, black or white hair is fine. \nPlease note she has a heart shaped mole over her left breast https://imgur.com/bdw6umJ\n\nMay be used on YT/Twitch so please include separate layers.\nThank you very much for your consideration, I look forward to working with you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mituse_/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8fb3c693/uploads/origins/d02d8189-4813-41a5-b35c-125202d38c46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=598db904f32f0275635eae5f2d40b733", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8fb3c693/uploads/origins/d02d8189-4813-41a5-b35c-125202d38c46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=598db904f32f0275635eae5f2d40b733, https://si.imgix.net/8fb3c693/uploads/origins/d02d8189-4813-41a5-b35c-125202d38c46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1568156e8d0b266951f9464bd84e76d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8fb3c693/uploads/origins/d02d8189-4813-41a5-b35c-125202d38c46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ef157ad6ab368a2cb89285cc1a68aad 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、あなたのアートはとてもかわいいです。\n\n私のoc、blooを描いていただけませんか？彼女は大人しいオオカミの女の子で、恥ずかしがり屋だけどいたずら好きなんだ。黒と青の髪、大きなふわふわの耳としっぽが特徴です!\nポーズや表情はお任せします。\n透過pngファイルでお願いできますか？\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/162YBUU6tGnZP4AjBniSbPd5dYtztaoAv/view?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/162YBUU6tGnZP4AjBniSbPd5dYtztaoAv/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mituse_/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/55913ba0/uploads/origins/1152c8c9-80b6-49fd-b4e1-2c26f0ee6663?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82cf96a34b1efa275b93cde6b19140fc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/55913ba0/uploads/origins/1152c8c9-80b6-49fd-b4e1-2c26f0ee6663?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82cf96a34b1efa275b93cde6b19140fc, https://si.imgix.net/55913ba0/uploads/origins/1152c8c9-80b6-49fd-b4e1-2c26f0ee6663?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54dea932d23d919bc5da5d7aa389d573 2x, https://si.imgix.net/55913ba0/uploads/origins/1152c8c9-80b6-49fd-b4e1-2c26f0ee6663?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eadfcf61307e121189c3efb812026a27 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "!!! The art came out so cute!! I also noticed from your tweet that its your birthday soon, so let me request 2 more pieces from you as a celebration ♡\n\nIt will be the same character as before, but this time can I have